      <title>The Political Right Is Losing Its Religion</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/opinion/articles/2026-10-02/the-political-right-is-losing-its-religion</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">a9c0b334ed1a780278306998</guid>
      <pubDate>Fri, 02 Oct 2026 12:00:01 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>One of the most surprising consequences of the Alternative for Germany’s spectacular success in two recent German state elections is a war between the radical-right party and the Christian establishment. The AfD wants to end the long-established system of state financial support for the major churches. The churches, which face a loss of subsidies worth €600 million ($675 million) a year nationwide and €40 million a year in Saxony-Anhalt alone, are predictably livid, warning that the change would</description>
