      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/opinion/articles/2026-10-02/uk-politics-andy-burnham-theory-of-growth-is-desperately-thin-stuff</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">1d64572e930a98533d37d946</guid>
      <pubDate>Fri, 02 Oct 2026 04:00:03 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>Andy Burnham’s speech at the Labour Party’s annual conference was memorable. Unlike his predecessor, the new British prime minister sounded heartfelt and hopeful. And he took a few big swings at hard policies as well. Reform is promised for elderly care and Britain’s bloated welfare regime, as is a “national conversation” on the relationship with the European Union and the UK’s outdated winner-takes-all electoral system.</description>
